# Line endings. See the longer explanation in pmt-api/.gitattributes.
#
# The one here that bites is nginx.conf: it is COPYied into the runtime image, and nginx
# rejects a directive whose line ends in \r with `unknown directive "listen 80;"` — a
# message that quotes a line which is, as far as anyone reading it can tell, correct.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
nginx.conf    text eol=lf
*.mjs         text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
